   "textLength": 643,
   "text": "The NSW Skills Lists outline the skills that are eligible for NSW nomination under the Skilled Nominated visa (subclass 190) and the Skilled Work Regional visa (subclass 491). These lists help identify the critical skills needed to support the growth and development of New South Wales.\nOur skills lists are at the ANZSCO Unit Group level. Please note that not all occupations within an ANZSCO Unit G",
